  "zh": "# 今日热点涵盖AI光刻机突破、电竞BLG战胜T1、社会老人数量数据、建筑火灾事件及国际特朗普行动等多领域热点。\n\n## AI与科技\n- **中国新一代光刻机模型亮相**：中国科技公司发布新一代光刻机，标志着国内半导体制造能力提升，可能重塑全球芯片竞争格局\n- **AI漫剧为何开始亏钱了**：AI创意产业面临盈利困境，技术突破不等于商业成功，市场接受度成为关键变量\n\n## 行业动向\n- **央视曝光后 江西赣州连夜成立调查组**：央视曝光低俗擦边广告乱象，引发社会舆论风波，调查组成立显示对内容监管的重视\n- **太原一建筑火灾已致14死**：太原建筑火灾致死14人，暴露城市消防和建筑安全管理漏洞，引发全国关注\n\n## 社会民生\n- **老人数量第一次比孩子多**：全国老人数量首次超儿童数量，反映人口结构深刻变化，社会养老需求迫在眉睫\n- **失业缓冲期首次出现在国家政策文件**：国家首次在政策文件中明确提出失业缓冲期，应对经济波动的措施值得关注\n\n## 国际视野\n- **特朗普：“铁门”特遣行动正全面展开**：特朗普领导“铁门”行动对美加关系产生深远影响，国际政治局势将持续紧张",
  "en": "# Today's hotspots cover AI lithography breakthrough, BLG beats T1 in S16, elderly population surpassing children, building fire deaths, unemployment buffer policy, and Trump's 'Iron Fist' operation.\n\n## AI & Technology\n- **China's new-generation lithography machine marks breakthrough**: A new Chinese light microscopy system signals a major leap in semiconductor manufacturing capability\n- **AI comics turn profitable? Why did they start losing money?**: AI-driven creative projects struggle to monetize despite technological advances\n\n## Industry Trends\n- **Central TV exposes lowbrow content, forms investigation team**: Central television's exposure of inappropriate content triggers public outcry and leads to a new investigation team\n- **Tangxiang building fire kills 14, safety concerns raised**: A Tangxiang building fire results in 14 deaths, highlighting urban safety and fire prevention issues\n\n## Social Affairs\n- **Elderly population surpasses children for the first time**: The elderly population becomes the largest demographic group, signaling significant social and economic challenges\n- **Unemployment buffer period introduced in national policy**: China's first national policy document mentions an unemployment buffer period, addressing economic volatility\n\n## International Outlook\n- **Trump: 'Iron Fist' special operation fully launched**: Trump's 'Iron Fist' action against China will have deep impact on US-China relations, international political situation will remain tense"
